@startuml
title DFD Level 1 - Analisis Sentimen QRIS & Cashless

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rect

actor "Pengguna (User)" as User

rectangle "1.0\nPreprocessing & Labeling" as P1
rectangle "2.0\nPelatihan Model" as P2
rectangle "3.0\nVisualisasi & Simulator" as P3

database "dataTwitter_20000.xlsx" as DB1
database "data_twitter_terlabeli.xlsx" as DB2
database "Model Pickle (.pkl)" as DB3

User --> P1 : Input data mentah / raw tweets
DB1 --> P1 : Ambil raw tweets
P1 --> DB2 : Simpan data bersih & terlabeli

DB2 --> P2 : Ambil data terlabeli
P2 --> DB3 : Simpan model (nb, svm, tfidf)

DB3 --> P3 : Load model & vectorizer
DB2 --> P3 : Load data untuk statistik
User --> P3 : Input teks live / request menu
P3 --> User : Tampilkan hasil prediksi & charts

@endum
